  9	
 10	**What this demands of an implementation:** “Rounding is floor on aggregate protocol fee; remainder must be allocated without loss.” Concretely, the protocol fee must be calculated once from the aggregate gross quote-token pot, any fractional quotient must be rounded toward the lower whole raw-token unit, and the post-rounding residual must remain in an allocated liability rather than disappear from accounting.
 11	
